{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "434d173fe06a7776cde0faa3319eb50880f02b3921ace0b6225a8cd72a39169f", "ja": "プロデューサーの仕事", "zh": "制作人的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "485662c75988396eb2fe66dfc1fcbcd3d62234637a5caeb1f76959d79f1b2634", "ja": "仕事帰り、悩んでいる様子の奈緒を見かける\nプロデューサー。話を聞くと、奈緒は響の\n厳しいレッスンに不安を感じている様子。\nプロデューサーは響も、そして自分も、皆や\n奈緒を信じているのだと伝え、励ます。", "zh": "工作结束后，制作人碰见愁眉苦脸的奈绪。\n一问之下，得知奈绪似乎是\n对响的严格训练感到不安。\n制作人告诉奈绪，响跟自己都相信着\n奈绪等人，并且加以鼓励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fabb43a796b84c0c2f80bda232a7072ea4b2e06ebd1d79ea27e512f90cc57b85", "ja": "（この時期は忙しいが、青羽さん達のおかげで、\n今日の仕事も無事に終わった……。さて、帰るか）", "zh": "（现在正值忙碌的时期，不过多亏了青羽小姐她们，\n今天的工作也顺利完成了……好，回去吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9eb9b8168ef5eac934eae0f6fd1c5cfcde92ba32154de628c81cab8a37fcb788", "ja": "ん？　あそこにいるのは……奈緒か。\nボーッとしてるけど、どうかしたのか……？", "zh": "嗯？站在那里的是……奈绪啊。\n看起来在发呆，不知道是怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "716d6dbccc8516dd2ec14c7e88e2813207fd34972c945952837917c54d3014bd", "ja": "奈緒、お疲れさま。", "zh": "奈绪，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "10a5485bbd15b5235b2134918c12b1efedfc2350ffacd2f367f9c6b65d7e761c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0a9a59cf596d71e8b928291e2758a4c878e75619ab5bff6e8c80332d90c53711", "ja": "……何か考え事でもしてたのか？", "zh": "……你在想事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "3950617de001a248c85bc91f4583ac284399e87c436eead9102a45bea0ab553b", "ja": "えっ。な、なんでわかったんです？　もしかして\n{$P$}さんって、エスパー！？", "zh": "咦？你、你怎么会知道？难道\n{$P$}先生有超能力！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "edef2f2f93e343608eafad1c75564ec721bb56f356ace2a3a09693ee22797e43", "ja": "そんなわけないだろ。\n……何か悩みがあるなら、相談にのるぞ。", "zh": "怎么可能啊。\n……如果你有什么烦恼，可以跟我商量喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "3f633bc0665a4390d539b87fab85897f88d79a1b76b38ed19d78b38660ab3e4e", "ja": "いえ、そんな。悩みとか、そんな\n大したこととちゃうんですけど……。", "zh": "也没有啦，\n不至于算得上是什么烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "87cedcce8d1860f3e947580360f99c33c853de3be36a4651f07fd738fe2d2a75", "ja": "でも、何か引っかかってるんだろ？\n奈緒が嫌じゃなければ、話してみてくれないか。", "zh": "不过你有点在意吧？\n如果奈绪你不排斥，能不能跟我说说看呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "72577defbe92c32b8f879a62ac2a5d73d43384505d4050b3bc383f2490d4f627", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わかりました。\nホンマ、大したことやないんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我知道了。\n虽然真的不是什么大不了的事啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "6f3540f91e0fd2bc747d6e6581fc95e232dd0f860d3fcf89ce48b92304b3bbd2", "ja": "この前、響と話して、改めて思ったんです。\n響はホンマにスゴいって。私より年下やのに。", "zh": "之前跟响聊过之后，我又重新感受到了。\n响是真的有够厉害，明明年纪比我还小耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "d334aa62a843247ce27d530b1f70495a3d924146b50dbec43b450d0dcf8bdab0", "ja": "けど、こうも思ったんです。「響は才能があるから、\nできひん人の気持ちが、わからへんのちゃうか」って。", "zh": "不过我还想到了另一件事，那就是「会不会正是因为\n有才华，响才无法了解做不到的人是什么心情呢」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ecf937c279a206c641b44239ff08644f1886d36eea748b14c0078fcf23062925", "ja": "……響がハイペースで\nレッスンを進めているのが、気になっているのか？", "zh": "……响的训练进度紧凑，\n让你很介意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "7a42664113a4d33eb72a88d2961c3bfc73cae370873ac00dd152bee82b973543", "ja": "はい。……仲間やし、私らも\n響と同じペースでがんばれたら、ええんやけど。", "zh": "是的……毕竟都是同伴，\n如果我们能跟上响的速度一起努力，那当然很好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "dc08236956522d0cdfc49bcf3e7f3e2af4892d009fa0f4d15509be30f6c001d1", "ja": "せやけど、みんながみんな、同じなわけやないし。\n響みたいに、ダンスの才能があるんとちゃいますやん。", "zh": "不过，每个人的条件都不同，\n不是人人都拥有跟响一样的舞蹈资质呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "e5b2f2a547c77ce27c24b4648d4db181ed1cd6a3395c3cf56525c0cb2c7bb1c4", "ja": "メンバーの誰かがレッスンについていけなくなって、\nバラバラになったりしたら……イヤやな、って……。", "zh": "我不想看到……成员中有人跟不上训练，\n变成一盘散沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f132005204d770b0d2560b9982806a79638214179e07b829482ed529208a667b", "ja": "奈緒が不安に思う気持ちも、わかるよ。\n今回の響は、ちょっとスパルタ気味だからな。", "zh": "我也能了解奈绪为什么会感到不安。\n毕竟这次，响的训练有点斯巴达呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "11c2c8cb02de70f87456ef8edb8c7905155181d00465b4f2b40aacb9fc4851ca", "ja": "けど、はりきってる響を見てて、思ったんだ。\n響があんなに厳しいのは、きっと……", "zh": "不过，看着响全力以赴的模样，让我觉得，\n她之所以对大家那么严格，一定是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_1018", "source_sha256": "36f2754bdcff1355115cfaeff940f4598a40cc8959b4b614540099f6d4a50574", "ja": "信じきってるから", "zh": "她深深相信着大家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "45e434884e93aad4acdbe96a75c13e3c0b0462ab795314c273d0c6f2f329fa1a", "ja": "きっと響は、奈緒達のことを信じきってて、\n疑ってないんじゃないかな？", "zh": "响应该是深深相信着奈绪你们，\n根本没有丝毫怀疑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "bc6f505194e5534d4038ac8b4efbf1f151506cd53a2363e4e1e8725a568ef4c8", "ja": "私らのことを、信じきってる……？\n{$P$}さん、それって……。", "zh": "深深相信着我们……？\n{$P$}先生，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9966552e841526e34c8ebe52e316c27a5e9b5fb81c0fb19ef8f9410de61fc7e3", "ja": "そう、奈緒達なら絶対、自分についてこれるって。\n本気でそう思ってるんだろうな。", "zh": "没错，我想她应该是真心相信，\n奈绪你们一定能够跟上她的脚步吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6bb85a45c7682f77a394afc76ae7780ac692d9c5304d815049f62d554ff335db", "ja": "そして、俺もそう思ってるんだ。\nすぐには無理でも、いつかは……って。", "zh": "而我也是这么想的。\n就算没办法马上办到，总有一天一定可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "4cc823709ab18546e7c3a29063fc56811dca13cba1cae361f42aa5edd59998bf", "ja": "ホンマに……ホンマに私も、響みたいに\nうまくできるようになると思います……？", "zh": "你真的……真的觉得我有可能变得\n跟响一样厉害吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2006_037nao", "source_sha256": "fda5e15a2c97b94c89032600dddfefe210686376ce2d694138a821c32752d0dd", "ja": "私な？　ホンマのこと言うと、アイドルをマジメに\n頑張るん、こんな大変やと思わんかってん。", "zh": "我吼，老实说，以前真的没想到，\n认真做偶像的工作会这么辛苦呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "dfc89046327118d5388324d7fc772c8d45a1faf4b6914d77b9ec711dba5f24db", "ja": "せやから、響を見てると、なんや……\nホンマに、すごすぎるわって思うて……。", "zh": "所以看着响的模样，就觉得……\n她真的是太厉害了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2008_p", "source_sha256": "c8bc4de9876a87c6a6b08f42b0ebab56f9e01f28b9c011d1e179b22a12ee20cc", "ja": "奈緒……。", "zh": "奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2009_p", "source_sha256": "3fdce4d8ae036b561d9cb19413131b3be66f210d1798d31aedae98cf1a13b241", "ja": "（……もしかしたら、誰よりも自分がレッスンに\nついていけなくなるのが……怖いのかな）", "zh": "（……她说不定，比谁都还要害怕……\n自己跟不上训练吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2011_p", "source_sha256": "000e42f0c20994b429e1d0ae8f795aed23de882fd1b67182399d7d02cbc582db", "ja": "まあ、たしかに外から見てるより、\nかなり大変だよな、アイドルって。", "zh": "嗯，偶像的工作的确比表面上看来\n还要辛苦得多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2012_p", "source_sha256": "0fe07c357fb22a194973abd65d6c55f4ec517728e3084f5a9e96c827f23014aa", "ja": "でも、俺は響のことも、皆のことも信じてるよ。\nもちろん奈緒のことも。", "zh": "不过我相信着响，也相信大家喔。\n当然也相信奈绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2013_p", "source_sha256": "52ca42d857e319d640509824905fd7450332d8c453a041ec2976d08468fed1f1", "ja": "でなきゃ、俺は奈緒をアイドルにしてないからな！", "zh": "要不然，我怎么会选奈绪你来当偶像呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2014_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2015_p", "source_sha256": "332e0144a7dd07b859eefa32ac2fc9912fed810d2395fe61664660ffdb733c20", "ja": "奈緒には『関西の星』になるって夢があるんだろ。\nなら、それを叶えるのが俺の仕事だ。", "zh": "奈绪的梦想是成为『关西之星』吧？\n既然如此，让这个梦想成真就是我的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2016_p", "source_sha256": "e5a7eb7ef3caa0e032fe912b1664ca73ba40026f7b728b993ec673311f179d7a", "ja": "だから奈緒は、すぐにうまくできなくても心配するな。\n……できるまで、俺が支えるからな！", "zh": "所以就算没办法马上做得很好，奈绪也不用担心。\n……我会一直支持你，直到你成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2017_037nao", "source_sha256": "a34929522833b30bfab3a4fc94770f5100331d0b2dca782b62ebbea273b67c2c", "ja": "……{$P$}さん、\n今日は珍しく、メッチャカッコええこと言いますね。", "zh": "……{$P$}先生，\n你今天难得说了超级帅气的话耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2018_p", "source_sha256": "e5fde04819251c752d7ed5324808ce32720d79939b439c49892ab6d02703c91d", "ja": "いやいや、けっこう言ってるつもりだけど？", "zh": "哪有啊，我平常也说很多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2019_037nao", "source_sha256": "2618fdeb4475650a1984d23899781ce51261260ac23a0d0ff43e3a34da2f7a17", "ja": "あははっ！　でも{$P$}さんの\nおかげで、なんやちょっと吹っ切れた気します。", "zh": "啊哈哈！不过，多亏了{$P$}先生，\n我觉得心情好像舒畅了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2020_037nao", "source_sha256": "2d4e2eea9078930a55b3e4d1e9c8c2786999506bb87c444131bd96505909480c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　どこまでできるか、\nわからんけど……私、精いっぱいやってみます！", "zh": "谢谢你！虽然不知道自己能够做到什么程度……\n我会尽全力去试试看的嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_04_2021_p", "source_sha256": "38a91296ff8df369a81c43487964409b008ec54b89597cf0d04430769b2b7664", "ja": "（奈緒にはやっぱり、笑顔が一番似合うな。\nこの笑顔を絶やさないよう、支えていかないと）", "zh": "（果然还是笑容最适合奈绪了。\n我必须在背后支持她，让她继续保持这份笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
